# Schneekugel shard: a broken piece of the snow globe's glass (w lit edge,
# h body, i edge on the shadow side) with a k outline and a fleck of snow.
# The renderer spawns 4 when a globe shatters (wall, stomp, axe), like
# brick debris. spin = the shard tumbles a quarter turn and
# the snow fleck (w in a k ring) swaps sides.
sprite = schneekugel_scherben
size   = 8x8
origin = 4,8
hitbox = 1,1,6,6
anim   = spin frames=2 ticks=4 loop
---
frame spin 0
......k.
...k.kwk
..kwk.k.
..kwhk..
.kwhhik.
.khhiik.
..kkkkk.
........
frame spin 1
........
.kkkkk..
.kwhhik.
.kwhik..
.khik.k.
.kik.kwk
..k...k.
........
